# Section
############################################################
Section::Begin("");

BEGIN_PGML
Conjecture a simple formula for [`S_n`] that is given by a single fraction where the numerator and/or denominator depend on [`n\text{.}`]

[_]{$f}{20}

_Hint_: Think of the numerator and denominator separately, and think of powers of [`2\text{.}`]

END_PGML

